PERFORMANCE

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.500
INTELLIGENCE

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.500
TECHNIQUE

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.160
Kuroitsu here.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.090
I just finished.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.730
<i>How'd it go?</i>

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.020
The new electromagnetic 
joints are looking good.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.760
<i>They should reach the test 
phase by the end of the month.</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.530
Glad to hear it.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.150
You can tell me all about it tomorrow.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.140
We're about done here for the day,

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.800
<i>so you can head right home.</i>

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.470
Right. I'll do that.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:17.750
<i>Good work today.</i>

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.280
Same to you.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:22.950
<i>All right!</i>

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:26.260
<i>This'll really increase the reaction 
speed of our next monster!</i>

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:30.370
<i>This might give us the speed we need 
to deal with Blader's second form!</i>

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.680
<i>Wow, that release of tension 
really has me hungry.</i>

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:39.950
<i>I've been on the move all day, 
so I guess I haven't eaten since breakfast.</i>

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:45.550
